    "POST %@/cmd/%@ to the Mac HTTP daemon (openaguja-macd, same Wi-Fi) with a Bearer token — works with the phone locked. Commands carry the action name; URL & token: Settings → Connections → Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "POST %1$@/cmd/%2$@ to the Mac HTTP daemon (openaguja-macd, same Wi-Fi) with a Bearer token — works with the phone locked. Commands carry the action name; URL & token: Settings → Connections → Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "POST %1$@/cmd/%2$@ vers le daemon HTTP du Mac (openaguja-macd, même Wi-Fi) avec un jeton Bearer — fonctionne téléphone verrouillé. Les commandes portent le nom de l'action ; URL et jeton : Réglages → Connexions → Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "POST JSON to the configured URL (Settings → Webhook server) with `{\"action\": \"%@\", …}` — the receiver must answer 2xx." : {
